    "name": "testing-for-broken-access-control",
    "description": "Systematically tests web applications and APIs for broken access control (OWASP A01:2021), including privilege escalation, missing function-level checks, insecure direct object references, and multi-tenant data leakage, using Burp Suite with the Authorize extension. Use during authorized penetration tests or RBAC/multi-tenant authorization audits.",
